处于 Terminating 状态（已持续 23 分钟）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因：Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 的 `finalizer` 中存在一个名为 `aiops.lab/hold` 的清理钩子（由诊断信息 `phenomenon` 直接指出，且符合 Pod 强杀后状态卡在 Terminating 的集群级特征）。\n\n证据支撑：\n1. **异常现象**：Pod 处于 `Terminating` 状态长达 23 分钟（证据 3）。\n2. **触发条件**：app 容器在 23 分钟前被强杀，退出码 137（证据 1、2）。\n3. **阻塞原因**：容器本身已经终止且正常处理过请求（证据 6、7），因此问题不在于应用层逻辑死锁，而在于 Kubernetes 对象层面的 `finalizer` 清理机制未能完成。在 Kubernetes 中，`finalizer` 未移除会导致 `kubectl delete` 或终止流程永久挂起。\n\n结论中明确指出，阻碍 Pod 被彻底删除的直接原因是 `aiops.lab/hold` 这个特定 finalizer 的阻塞。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 127.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 127.9s (Evidence 123.6s, RCA 4.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 156.557, "metrics": {"run_id": "3b140ada760b4d40", "mttr": {"value": "2.6m", "seconds": 156.56484842300415, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 156564.84842300415, "llm_calls": 22, "llm_duration_ms": 119917.29998588562, "tool_calls": 33, "executed_tool_calls": 25, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 7, "successful_tool_calls": 32, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 90291.06736183167, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 36179.911613464355}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13338.167190551758, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 127932.76977539062, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 15272.938013076782, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

